  "description": "UI-4 (HANDOFF_Behaviors_To_Ui_Platoon_Demos, CE-2290) \u2014 cqb-village, the platoon demos' stage: exactly DESIGN_Platoon_Attack_Defend_Clear \u00a712.1's map (img/cqb-village.svg, 1 m = 2.2 px). Main Street y 184..196 and the Cross Road x 194..206 are open ground (no road network: the demos are on foot). South of Main Street, fronts north: H1 (house-2f), OBJ (house-3f), H3 (house-2f); north of it, fronts south: H6, H4, H5 the ambush house (house-2f), SNP the sniper hide (house-3f). CMP the walled compound (2 m concrete, a 4 m west gate, four 1.2 m sandbag posts, a solid shed); the hedge row (the covered west route), the 1 m low wall, a 1 m berm, the wreck, the support-line berm 112 m south of OBJ. Local metres, X east, Y north, Z up; flat ground."
